	\item $\tildeEx{p^2 \cdot \prod_{i \in S} g_i} \geq 0$, $\forall\, S \subseteq [r]$ and $\forall\, p$ such that $\deg(p^2\cdot \prod_{i \in S} g_i) \leq t$.
