Let $\F$ be a polynomial system of equations with $\deg(\F) \leq d$.\\ 
If there exists a $\deg_k$-$\IPS$ refutation $C$ of $\F$, then there is also a skew $\vec y$-linear $\deg_{dk}$-$\IPS$ refutation of size at most $\BigO(|\Circ|^{dk})$.

