Given a threshold game defined on the directed graph $H=(V,E)$ and threshold $t$, a strategy profile $x=(x_u)_{u\in V}\in [0,1]^{|V|}$ is an $(\kappa, \delta)$-equilibrium of the threshold game if for at least $(1-\delta)$-fraction of the vertices, we have
    \begin{align*}
