\begin{align*}
    \tilde{O}\qty(\qty(\frac{1}{\eps})^{1 - \frac{1}{a} + o(1)})
\end{align*}
memory, where $\tilde{O}(\cdot)$ suppresses $O(\poly\log(n))$ factors. Furthermore, this bound is tight when $d = \Theta(\log^a n)$ for any constant $a > 2$, i.e. there is a
