		\item Soundness: If $x\in\ano$, then $\exists \rho_1 \forall \rho_2 \ldots \overline{Q}_i \rho_i$ such that $V_n$ accepts $({\rho_1 \otimes \rho_2 \otimes \cdots \otimes  \rho_i})$ with probability $\leq s$.
