\label{prop:different-alternation}
For $2 \leq d \leq  {\frac {c\sqrt{\log n}}{\log \log n}}$,
let $C : \zo^{A_d} \to \zo$ be a depth-$d$ circuit of size $S \le 2^{\frac1{2}w^{1/5}}$ and unbounded bottom fan-in.
\begin{enumerate}
