\label{clm:Z}
Assume the following conditions hold.
\begin{equation*}
\Pr_{(x,\ell) \leftarrow XL} (\VR((\Pi U_\ell)^{x},\Pi^x  \otimes U_\ell  ) > \sqrt{\delta} )  < 0.01. \tag{\ref{eq:X}}
