Let  $P$ and $Q$ be any two multivariate polynomials in $\F[X_1, X_2, \ldots, X_{N}]$.  Let ${\cal M}$ be any set of monomials and $m$ be any positive integer. Then, for all scalars $\alpha$ and $\beta$
